    "markdown": "# Data {#sec-data}\n\n\n::: {.callout-important}\n## AI-generated — not for publication\nThe code and prose in this book were written by an AI agent under human direction; they have not been\nverified line by line and must not be published or cited as-is.\n:::\n\n::: {.callout-warning}\n## Preliminary & unvetted analysis\nExploratory analysis. Exposure counts were hand-coded from import scripts and source papers and are\nstill being checked; see the confidence column in `metadata/exposure_design.csv`.\n:::\n\n\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nlibrary(tidyverse)\nlibrary(peekbankr)\nlibrary(here)\ni_am(\"notebooks/01-data.qmd\")  # _quarto.yml would otherwise make notebooks/ the root\n\nRELEASE <- \"2026.1\"\nCACHE <- here(\"cache\", \"01_peekbank_novel.rds\")\n```\n:::\n\n\n\n\n\nWe pull all metadata tables, find every dataset that has a novel word as a target or\ndistractor stimulus, and download the AOI timepoints only for those datasets.\nThe result is cached in `cache/`, which is gitignored. Delete the cache file to force a fresh pull.\nThis requires a `REDIVIS_API_TOKEN` with the `data.metadata` scope.\n\n\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nif (!file.exists(CACHE)) {\n  pb <- peekbank(RELEASE)\n\n  meta <- list(\n    datasets = pb$datasets,\n    subjects = pb$subjects,\n    administrations = pb$administrations,\n    trials = pb$trials,\n    trial_types = pb$trial_types,\n    stimuli = pb$stimuli\n  )\n\n  novel_datasets <- meta$stimuli |>\n    filter(stimulus_novelty == \"novel\") |>\n    distinct(dataset_name) |>\n    pull(dataset_name)\n\n  aoi <- pb$subset$aoi_timepoints(dataset_name %in% !!novel_datasets)\n\n  saveRDS(c(meta, list(aoi_timepoints = aoi, novel_datasets = novel_datasets,\n                       release = RELEASE)),\n          CACHE)\n}\n\nd <- readRDS(CACHE)\nstopifnot(d$release == RELEASE)\n```\n:::\n\n\n\n\n\n## Datasets with novel words\n\n\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nnovel_summary <- d$administrations |>\n  filter(dataset_name %in% d$novel_datasets) |>\n  group_by(dataset_name) |>\n  summarise(n_subjects = n_distinct(subject_id),\n            n_admins = n(),\n            min_age = min(age, na.rm = TRUE),\n            max_age = max(age, na.rm = TRUE)) |>\n  left_join(d$datasets |> select(dataset_name, shortcite), by = \"dataset_name\") |>\n  relocate(shortcite, .after = dataset_name)\n\nnovel_summary\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n`````{=html}\n<div data-pagedtable=\"false\">\n  <script data-pagedtable-source type=\"application/json\">\n{\"columns\":[{\"label\":[\"dataset_name\"],\"name\":[1],\"type\":[\"chr\"],\"align\":[\"left\"]},{\"label\":[\"shortcite\"],\"name\":[2],\"type\":[\"chr\"],\"align\":[\"left\"]},{\"label\":[\"n_subjects\"],\"name\":[3],\"type\":[\"int\"],\"align\":[\"right\"]},{\"label\":[\"n_admins\"],\"name\":[4],\"type\":[\"int\"],\"align\":[\"right\"]},{\"label\":[\"min_age\"],\"name\":[5],\"type\":[\"dbl\"],\"align\":[\"right\"]},{\"label\":[\"max_age\"],\"name\":[6],\"type\":[\"dbl\"],\"align\":[\"right\"]}],\"data\":[{\"1\":\"adams_marchman_2018\",\"2\":\"Adams et al. (2018)\",\"3\":\"69\",\"4\":\"711\",\"5\":\"13.00000\",\"6\":\"38.00000\"},{\"1\":\"baumgartner_2014\",\"2\":\"Baumgartner (2014)\",\"3\":\"100\",\"4\":\"100\",\"5\":\"12.00000\",\"6\":\"13.00000\"},{\"1\":\"byers-heinlein_2022\",\"2\":\"Byers-Heinlein et al. (2022)\",\"3\":\"38\",\"4\":\"38\",\"5\":\"37.13073\",\"6\":\"48.94456\"},{\"1\":\"fernald_marchman_2012\",\"2\":\"Fernald & Marchman (2012)\",\"3\":\"122\",\"4\":\"679\",\"5\":\"17.00000\",\"6\":\"32.00000\"},{\"1\":\"fernald_totlot\",\"2\":\"Fernald et al. (2006)\",\"3\":\"63\",\"4\":\"229\",\"5\":\"15.00000\",\"6\":\"25.00000\"},{\"1\":\"frank_tablet_2016\",\"2\":\"Frank et al. (2016)\",\"3\":\"108\",\"4\":\"108\",\"5\":\"12.13151\",\"6\":\"59.83562\"},{\"1\":\"moore_bergelson_2022_verb\",\"2\":\"Moore & Bergelson (2022)\",\"3\":\"98\",\"4\":\"98\",\"5\":\"15.49342\",\"6\":\"28.48684\"},{\"1\":\"pomper_dimy\",\"2\":\"Pomper & Saffran (unpublished)\",\"3\":\"82\",\"4\":\"82\",\"5\":\"14.00000\",\"6\":\"19.00000\"},{\"1\":\"pomper_salientme\",\"2\":\"Pomper & Saffran (2019)\",\"3\":\"44\",\"4\":\"44\",\"5\":\"38.00000\",\"6\":\"43.00000\"},{\"1\":\"pomper_yumme\",\"2\":\"Pomper & Saffran (2018)\",\"3\":\"69\",\"4\":\"69\",\"5\":\"25.00000\",\"6\":\"43.00000\"},{\"1\":\"reflook_socword\",\"2\":\"Yurovsky et al., 2013\",\"3\":\"427\",\"4\":\"427\",\"5\":\"11.93425\",\"6\":\"69.73151\"},{\"1\":\"reflook_v4\",\"2\":\"Yurovsky et al. (2024)\",\"3\":\"347\",\"4\":\"347\",\"5\":\"8.40000\",\"6\":\"83.76000\"},{\"1\":\"swingley_aslin_2002\",\"2\":\"Swingley & Aslin (2002)\",\"3\":\"50\",\"4\":\"50\",\"5\":\"14.12731\",\"6\":\"16.00000\"},{\"1\":\"yurovsky_2017\",\"2\":\"Yurovsky & Frank (2017)\",\"3\":\"288\",\"4\":\"288\",\"5\":\"12.59160\",\"6\":\"58.65240\"}],\"options\":{\"columns\":{\"min\":{},\"max\":[10]},\"rows\":{\"min\":[10],\"max\":[10]},\"pages\":{}}}\n  </script>\n</div>\n`````\n:::\n:::\n\n\n\n\n\nNot all of these are novel-word *learning* datasets. Two code mispronunciations as \"novel\"\n(`swingley_aslin_2002`, `moore_bergelson_2022_verb`); they are excluded in @sec-exposure.\n\n## Full citations\n\n\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nd$datasets |>\n  filter(dataset_name %in% d$novel_datasets) |>\n  select(dataset_name, cite)\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n`````{=html}\n<div data-pagedtable=\"false\">\n  <script data-pagedtable-source type=\"application/json\">\n{\"columns\":[{\"label\":[\"dataset_name\"],\"name\":[1],\"type\":[\"chr\"],\"align\":[\"left\"]},{\"label\":[\"cite\"],\"name\":[2],\"type\":[\"chr\"],\"align\":[\"left\"]}],\"data\":[{\"1\":\"adams_marchman_2018\",\"2\":\"Adams, K. A., Marchman, V. A., Loi, E. C., Ashland, M. D., Fernald, A., & Feldman, H. M. (2018). Caregiver talk and medical risk as predictors of language outcomes in full term and preterm toddlers. Child Development, 89(5), 1674-1690. https://doi.org/10.1111/cdev.12818\"},{\"1\":\"baumgartner_2014\",\"2\":\"Baumgartner, H. A. (2014). Understanding the Role of Non-Contrastive Variability in Word Learning and Visual Attention in Infancy (UMI 3685177). [Doctoral dissertation, University of California, Davis]. ProQuest Dissertations Publishing.\"},{\"1\":\"byers-heinlein_2022\",\"2\":\"Byers-Heinlein, K., Jardak, A., Fourakis, E., & Lew-Williams, C. (2022). Effects of language mixing on bilingual children's word learning. Bilingualism, 25(1): 55-69.\"},{\"1\":\"fernald_marchman_2012\",\"2\":\"Fernald, A., & Marchman, V. A. (2012). Individual differences in lexical processing at 18 months predict vocabulary growth in typically developing and late<U+2010>talking toddlers. Child development, 83(1), 203-222.  https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1467-8624.2011.01692.x\"},{\"1\":\"fernald_totlot\",\"2\":\"Fernald, A., Perfors, A., & Marchman, V. A. (2006). Picking up speed in understanding: Speech processing efficiency and vocabulary growth across the 2nd year.Developmental Psychology, 42(1), 98<U+2013>116.\"},{\"1\":\"frank_tablet_2016\",\"2\":\"Frank, M. C., Sugarman, E., Horowitz, A. C., Lewis, M. L., & Yurovsky, D. (2016). Using tablets to collect data from young children. Journal of Cognition and Development, 17(1), 1-17.\"},{\"1\":\"moore_bergelson_2022_verb\",\"2\":\"Moore, C., & Bergelson, E. (2022). Examining the roles of regularity and lexical class in 18<U+2013>26-month-olds<U+2019> representations of how words sound. Journal of Memory and Language, 126, 104337.\"},{\"1\":\"pomper_yumme\",\"2\":\"Pomper, R., & Saffran, J. R. (2018). More than distractors: Familiar objects influence toddlers' semantic representations in novel word learning. XXI Biennial International Congress of Infant Studies. Philadelphia, PA (poster).\"},{\"1\":\"pomper_salientme\",\"2\":\"Pomper, R., & Saffran, J. R. (2019). Familiar object salience affects novel word learning. Child Development, 90(2), e246-e262. doi:10.1111/cdev.13053\"},{\"1\":\"pomper_dimy\",\"2\":\"Pomper, R., & Saffran, J. (unpublished). Unpublished 'Dimy' study: Do infants learn to associate diminutive forms with animates?\"},{\"1\":\"swingley_aslin_2002\",\"2\":\"Swingley, D., & Aslin, R. N. (2002). Lexical Neighborhoods and the Word-Form Representations of 14-Month-Olds. Psychological Science, 13(5), 480-484. https://doi.org/10.1111/1467-9280.00485\"},{\"1\":\"yurovsky_2017\",\"2\":\"Yurovsky, D., & Frank, M. C. (2017). Beyond na<U+00EF>ve cue combination: Salience and social cues in early word learning. Developmental Science, 20(2), e12349. doi: 10.1111/desc.12349.\"},{\"1\":\"reflook_v4\",\"2\":\"Yurovsky, D., Wade, A., Kraus, A. M., Gengoux, G. W., Hardan, A. Y., Frank, M. C. (2024). Developmental changes in the speed of social attention in early word learning. https://osf.io/preprints/psyarxiv/bcrj2_v1\"},{\"1\":\"reflook_socword\",\"2\":\"Yurovsky, D., Wade, A., & Frank, M. C. (2013). Online processing of speech and social information in early word learning. In Proceedings of the 35th Annual Meeting of the Cognitive Science Society.\"}],\"options\":{\"columns\":{\"min\":{},\"max\":[10]},\"rows\":{\"min\":[10],\"max\":[10]},\"pages\":{}}}\n  </script>\n</div>\n`````\n:::\n:::\n\n\n\n\n\n## Timepoint data\n\n\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nd$aoi_timepoints |>\n  left_join(d$administrations |> select(administration_id, dataset_name),\n            by = \"administration_id\") |>\n  group_by(dataset_name) |>\n  summarise(n_admins = n_distinct(administration_id),\n            n_trials = n_distinct(trial_id),\n            n_samples = n())\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n`````{=html}\n<div data-pagedtable=\"false\">\n  <script data-pagedtable-source type=\"application/json\">\n{\"columns\":[{\"label\":[\"dataset_name\"],\"name\":[1],\"type\":[\"chr\"],\"align\":[\"left\"]},{\"label\":[\"n_admins\"],\"name\":[2],\"type\":[\"int\"],\"align\":[\"right\"]},{\"label\":[\"n_trials\"],\"name\":[3],\"type\":[\"int\"],\"align\":[\"right\"]},{\"label\":[\"n_samples\"],\"name\":[4],\"type\":[\"int\"],\"align\":[\"right\"]}],\"data\":[{\"1\":\"adams_marchman_2018\",\"2\":\"711\",\"3\":\"25016\",\"4\":\"5209686\"},{\"1\":\"baumgartner_2014\",\"2\":\"100\",\"3\":\"797\",\"4\":\"251055\"},{\"1\":\"byers-heinlein_2022\",\"2\":\"38\",\"3\":\"574\",\"4\":\"195223\"},{\"1\":\"fernald_marchman_2012\",\"2\":\"679\",\"3\":\"21542\",\"4\":\"8121334\"},{\"1\":\"fernald_totlot\",\"2\":\"229\",\"3\":\"6085\",\"4\":\"814915\"},{\"1\":\"frank_tablet_2016\",\"2\":\"108\",\"3\":\"2592\",\"4\":\"778142\"},{\"1\":\"moore_bergelson_2022_verb\",\"2\":\"98\",\"3\":\"2783\",\"4\":\"698911\"},{\"1\":\"pomper_dimy\",\"2\":\"82\",\"3\":\"1631\",\"4\":\"489698\"},{\"1\":\"pomper_salientme\",\"2\":\"44\",\"3\":\"1669\",\"4\":\"402229\"},{\"1\":\"pomper_yumme\",\"2\":\"69\",\"3\":\"1620\",\"4\":\"306908\"},{\"1\":\"reflook_socword\",\"2\":\"427\",\"3\":\"8512\",\"4\":\"2551855\"},{\"1\":\"reflook_v4\",\"2\":\"347\",\"3\":\"5449\",\"4\":\"1310043\"},{\"1\":\"swingley_aslin_2002\",\"2\":\"50\",\"3\":\"1111\",\"4\":\"178871\"},{\"1\":\"yurovsky_2017\",\"2\":\"288\",\"3\":\"5760\",\"4\":\"1215360\"}],\"options\":{\"columns\":{\"min\":{},\"max\":[10]},\"rows\":{\"min\":[10],\"max\":[10]},\"pages\":{}}}\n  </script>\n</div>\n`````\n:::\n:::\n",
